      "type": "text",
      "text": "Influenza: oseltamivir (PO) or zanamivir (inhaled) for 5 days, best w.in 48 hrs of onset; peramivir IV or baloxavir PO as single doses; hsp pts get a neuraminidase inhibitor even after 48 hrs."
     }
